{"t":"WAT","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Waters Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Diagnostics & Research","employees":15000,"hq":"Milford, MA, United States","website":"https://www.waters.com","summary_en":"Waters Corporation provides analytical workflow solutions in Asia, the Americas, and Europe. The company operates through two segments, Waters and TA. The company designs, manufactures, sells, and services liquid chromatography, as well as mass spectrometry (MS) technology systems and supports products, including chromatography columns, and other consumable products. It also designs, manufactures, sells, and services thermal analysis, rheometry, and calorimetry instruments for use in predicting the suitability and stability of fine chemicals, pharmaceuticals, water, polymers, metals, and viscous liquids for various industrial, consumer goods, and healthcare products, as well as for life science research; and develops and supplies software-based products that interface with its instruments, as well as other manufacturers' instruments. In addition, the company offers MS technology, which is used in drug discovery and development comprising clinical trial testing, the analysis of proteins in disease processes, nutritional safety analysis, and environmental testing. Its products are used by clinical, pharmaceutical, biochemical, industrial, nutritional safety, environmental, academic, and governmental customers working in research and development, quality assurance, and other laboratory applications. The company was founded in 1958 and is headquartered in Milford, Massachusetts.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Waters Corporation은 아시아, 미주, 유럽에 분석 워크플로우 솔루션을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 Waters와 TA라는 두 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 액체 크로마토그래피와 질량 분석기(MS) 기술 시스템을 설계, 제조, 판매 및 서비스하고 크로마토그래피 컬럼 및 기타 소모품을 포함한 제품을 지원합니다. 또한 생명 과학 연구뿐만 아니라 다양한 산업, 소비재, 의료 제품에 대한 정밀 화학, 의약품, 물, 폴리머, 금속 및 점성 액체의 적합성과 안정성을 예측하는 데 사용되는 열 분석, 유변 측정, 열량 측정 기기를 설계, 제조, 판매 및 서비스합니다. 자사 장비는 물론 다른 제조업체의 장비와 인터페이스하는 소프트웨어 기반 제품을 개발 및 공급합니다. 또한 회사는 임상 시험 테스트, 질병 과정의 단백질 분석, 영양 안전성 분석 및 환경 테스트로 구성된 신약 발견 및 개발에 사용되는 MS 기술을 제공합니다. 해당 제품은 연구 개발, 품질 보증 및 기타 실험실 응용 분야에서 일하는 임상, 제약, 생화학, 산업, 영양 안전, 환경, 학계 및 정부 고객이 사용합니다. 이 회사는 1958년에 설립되었으며 매사추세츠주 밀포드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":453.08,"mcap":44486045696.0,"pe":189.57321,"fpe":27.401535,"peg":1.7409,"ps":7.929372,"pb":2.9113386,"ev_ebitda":34.865,"div":0.0,"beta":1.148,"hi52":482.28,"lo52":282.77},"fin":{"rev":5610286080.0,"rev_g":1.209,"eps_g":-0.672,"gross":0.49827,"op":0.11375,"net":0.01758,"roe":0.01119,"fcf":null,"cash":593000000.0,"debt":5133000192.0,"de":33.569,"eps":2.39,"feps":16.53484},"own":{"short":0.0325,"inst":1.02496,"insider":0.00104},"analyst":{"n":22,"mean":474.72726,"median":477.5,"high":550.0,"low":349.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.6087,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":15,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":15,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":15,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":14,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":536.0,"priorPriceTarget":470.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":470.0,"priorPriceTarget":435.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"TD Cowen","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":530.0,"priorPriceTarget":515.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":530.0,"priorPriceTarget":500.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action"